nt transition "></span></div></button></div></nav><main class="relative z-[1] max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12"><section id="top" class="min-h-screen flex items-center gap-14 flex-wrap pt-24 pb-12"><div class="flex-1 min-w-[300px]"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/25 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet animate-pulse2"></span>Open to work &amp; new projects</span><h1 class="text-[clamp(38px,6.5vw,68px)] font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">Hi, I&#x27;m <span class="grad-text">Melonz</span></h1><div class="font-mono text-[clamp(16px,2.4vw,20px)] text-dim mt-3.5 min-h-[1.5em]"><span class="inline-block w-0.5 h-[1.05em] bg-violet align-text-bottom ml-0.5 animate-blink"></span></div><p class="text-dim mt-5 max-w-[46ch] text-[15.5px]">I currently focus on <span class="text-ink font-semibold">Linux</span> — server administration, shell scripting, and building systems that run reliably on their own. I feel most at home in the terminal, and I enjoy crafting infrastructure that is clean and dependable.</p><div class="mt-8 flex gap-3.5 flex-wrap"><a href="#projects" class="font-semibold text-[14.5px] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-white bg-gradient-to-br from-violet to-violet-dk shadow-[0_8px_28px_-8px_rgba(168,85,247,.4)] hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_14px_38px_-8px_rgba(168,85,247,.4)] transition-all">View my work →</a><a href="#contact" class="font-semibold text-[14.5px] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface hover:border-violet hover:text-violet-lt hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">Get in touch</a></div></div><div class="flex-none mx-auto sm:mx-0"><div class="relative w-[clamp(220px,32vw,300px)] aspect-square"><div class="absolute -inset-3.5 rounded-[28px] blur-[2px] animate-spin6 bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,#a855f7,transparent_40%,#7c3aed_70%,#a855f7)]"></div><img src="/assets/profile.jpg" alt="Melonz Velia" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[22px] border-2 border-line z-10"/><div class="absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 z-20 bg-surface border border-line rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-[0_8px_24px_-8px_rgba(0,0,0,.6)]"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_#22c55e]"></span>online &amp; coding</div></div></div></section><section id="about" class="py-[clamp(70px,10vw,110px)]"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-violet-lt mb-2.5">// a quick introduction</div><h2 class="text-[clamp(26px,4vw,40px)] font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3.5">About me</h2></div><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] mt-6"><div class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[18px] p-7 sm:p-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><p class="text-dim text-[15px]">I am a developer who would rather be building something than sitting idle. Lately, most of my time goes into <span class="text-ink font-semibold">Linux</span> — administering servers, writing shell scripts, and turning tedious, repetitive tasks into processes that run automatically.</p><p class="text-dim text-[15px] mt-3.5">The terminal is where I feel most productive. There is a certain satisfaction in watching a single command handle work that once took hours. I like to understand how systems operate <span class="text-ink font-semibold">from the ground up</span>, rather than only scratching the surface.</p><p class="text-dim text-[15px] mt-3.5">I also enjoy building things from scratch. One project I am particularly proud of is<!-- --> <span class="text-ink font-semibold">Senzu</span>, which I describe in more detail below. In short: I am always working on something — if I am not managing a server, I am putting together a new project.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3.5" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="bg-bg2 border border-line rounded-[14px] p-[18px]"><div class="text-[26px] font-extrabold grad-text leading-none">Linux</div><div class="text-[12.5px] text-dim mt-2">my primary environment, every single day</div></div><div class="bg-bg2 border border-line rounded-[14px] p-[18px]"><div class="text-[26px] font-extrabold grad-text leading-none">24/7</div><div class="text-[12.5px] text-dim mt-2">uptime target — servers should never lag</div></div><div class="bg-bg2 border border-line rounded-[14px] p-[18px]"><div class="text-[26px] font-extrabold grad-text leading-none">sh</div><div class="text-[12.5px] text-dim mt-2">shell scripting to automate anything</div></div><div class="bg-bg2 border border-line rounded-[14px] p-[18px]"><div class="text-[26px] font-extrabold grad-text leading-none">∞</div><div class="text-[12.5px] text-dim mt-2">cups of coffee sacrificed along the way</div></div></div></div></section><section id="stack" class="py-[clamp(70px,10vw,110px)]"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-violet-lt mb-2.5">// tools of the trade</div><h2 class="text-[clamp(26px,4vw,40px)] font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3.5">What I work with</h2><p class="text-dim max-w-[52ch] mb-11 text-[15px]">Not the longest list, but every item here is something I genuinely understand and use regularly. I would rather master a few tools deeply than know many of them only halfway.</p></div><div class="space-y-7"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[12.5px] text-dim mb-3">primary focus<!-- -->:</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Linux</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Bash / Shell</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>SSH</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Nginx</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Docker</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>systemd</span></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[12.5px] text-dim mb-3">everyday development<!-- -->:</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>JavaScript</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>TypeScript</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Node.js</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Python</span></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[12.5px] text-dim mb-3">front-end<!-- -->:</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>React</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Next.js</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Tailwind</span></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[12.5px] text-dim mb-3">data &amp; the rest<!-- -->:</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>MongoDB</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>PostgreSQL</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>Git</span><span class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[11px] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:border-violet hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-violet-lt transition-all"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-violet"></span>VPS</span></div></div></div></section><section id="projects" class="py-[clamp(70px,10vw,110px)]"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-violet-lt mb-2.5">// selected work</div><h2 class="text-[clamp(26px,4vw,40px)] font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3.5">Projects I&#x27;m proud of</h2><p class="text-dim max-w-[52ch] mb-11 text-[15px]">I don&#x27;t have many pieces on display yet, but the ones here were built with real care. Quality first — quantity can follow.</p></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><article class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden flex flex-wrap hover:border-violet/40 hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_-24px_rgba(168,85,247,.35)] transition-all"><div class="flex-[0_0_100%] sm:flex-[0_0_38%] min-h-[220px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1a1526] to-[#241a38] grid place-items-center relative p-8"><span class="absolute top-3.5 left-3.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-violet-lt bg-bg/70 border border-violet/30 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">flagship project</span><img src="/assets/senzu.jpg" alt="Senzu Hub" class="w-[48%] max-w-[140px] max-h-[140px] object-contain bg-transparent drop-shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(168,85,247,.35)]"/></div><div class="flex-1 min-w-[280px] p-6 sm:p-8"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2.5 flex-wrap">Senzu Hub<span class="text-[11px] font-medium text-green-400 bg-green-500/12 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-green-500/25">● actively maintained</span></h3><p class="text-dim text-[14.5px] mb-3">This one is close to my heart. Senzu is a bot that runs on both WhatsApp (via Baileys) and Discord (via discord.js) at the same time, managed from a single unified system.</p><p class="text-dim text-[14.5px] mb-4">What I&#x27;m most proud of is how modular it is. Adding a new feature is as simple as dropping in a single plugin file — it registers instantly without breaking anything else. The database is integrated, the command handler is clean, and most importantly, I built the whole thing from scratch rather than cloning a template.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-[18px]"><span class="text-[11.5px] text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Node.js</span><span class="text-[11.5px] text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Baileys</span><span class="text-[11.5px] text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">discord.js</span><span class="text-[11.5px] text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">WhatsApp Bot</span><span class="text-[11.5px] text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Discord Bot</span><span class="text-[11.5px] text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Plugin System</span></div><div class="flex gap-[18px] text-sm items-center"><span class="font-mono text-[12.5px] text-dim bg-bg2 border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg">🔒 private repository</span></div></div></article></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><p class="text-center text-dim text-[13.5px] mt-8 font-mono">// more projects currently in the works — stay tuned</p></div></section><section id="blog" class="py-[clamp(70px,10vw,110px)]"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-violet-lt mb-2.5">// notes &amp; writing</div><h2 class="text-[clamp(26px,4vw,40px)] font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3.5">From my notebook</h2><p class="text-dim max-w-[52ch] mb-11 text-[15px]">Every so often I write about what I&#x27;m learning — partly to remember it, and partly in case it helps someone else. Mostly Linux, the terminal, and whatever else has caught my curiosity.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><a href="/blog/moving-to-the-terminal" class="group flex flex-col h-full bg-surface border border-line rounded-[18px] p-6 hover:border-violet/40 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_-24px_rgba(168,85,247,.35)] transition-all"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4 text-[12px]"><span class="text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Linux</span><span class="text-dim font-mono">Sep 2026</span></div><h3 class="text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug mb-2.5 group-hover:text-violet-lt transition-colors">Why I moved entirely to the terminal (and never looked back)</h3><p class="text-dim text-[14px] mb-5 flex-1">It was awkward at first — tired eyes, constant typos. But once it clicked, I couldn&#x27;t go back. Here&#x27;s how the terminal reshaped the way I work.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[12.5px] text-dim mt-auto"><span class="font-mono">5 min read</span><span class="text-violet-lt group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">read →</span></div></a></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><a href="/blog/automating-the-boring-parts" class="group flex flex-col h-full bg-surface border border-line rounded-[18px] p-6 hover:border-violet/40 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_-24px_rgba(168,85,247,.35)] transition-all"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4 text-[12px]"><span class="text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Automation</span><span class="text-dim font-mono">Aug 2026</span></div><h3 class="text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug mb-2.5 group-hover:text-violet-lt transition-colors">Automating the boring parts with shell scripts</h3><p class="text-dim text-[14px] mb-5 flex-1">If you do something more than twice, it&#x27;s worth automating. I walk through a few small scripts that quietly save me time every single day.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[12.5px] text-dim mt-auto"><span class="font-mono">7 min read</span><span class="text-violet-lt group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">read →</span></div></a></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><a href="/blog/one-brain-two-platforms" class="group flex flex-col h-full bg-surface border border-line rounded-[18px] p-6 hover:border-violet/40 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_-24px_rgba(168,85,247,.35)] transition-all"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4 text-[12px]"><span class="text-violet-lt bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Development</span><span class="text-dim font-mono">Jul 2026</span></div><h3 class="text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug mb-2.5 group-hover:text-violet-lt transition-colors">One brain, two platforms: lessons from building Senzu</h3><p class="text-dim text-[14px] mb-5 flex-1">Running a single bot across WhatsApp and Discord sounds simple until you try it. Here&#x27;s what I learned designing Senzu to serve both from one core.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[12.5px] text-dim mt-auto"><span class="font-mono">8 min read</span><span class="text-violet-lt group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">read →</span></div></a></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="py-[clamp(70px,10vw,110px)]"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-surface to-bg2 border border-line rounded-[24px] p-8 sm:p-12 text-center"><div class="absolute -top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[360px] h-[360px] rounded-full opacity-50 bg-[radial-gradient(rgba(168,85,247,.35),transparent_70%)]"></div><div class="relative"><h2 class="text-[clamp(24px,4vw,36px)] font-extrabold tracking